  "title": "Trex Celebrates 25 Years Of Its TrexPro® Program",
  "summary": "WINCHESTER, Va. (February 26, 2026) – Trex Company, the world’s #1 brand of wood-alternative decking and railing, and a leader in high-performance, low-maintenance outdoor living products, is celebrating the 25th anniversary of its TrexPro® contractor loyalty program. This milestone coincides with Trex’s 30th anniversary, underscoring the company’s long-standing commitment to innovation, partnership and professional excellence.",
